---
// The original site embedded a live Instagram feed plugin (Spotlight)
// showing the 5 most recent @capetowncannonchallenge posts. That plugin's
// cached post images weren't part of this backup, and a static rebuild
// can't reproduce a live feed without wiring up the Instagram API — so
// this is a simple outbound CTA instead of faked grid tiles.
// TODO: swap for a real live/curated grid once Instagram API access (or a
// manually curated set of real post images) is available.
---

<section class="instagram-cta section">
  <div class="container instagram-cta__inner reveal">
    <h2>Follow the Challenge</h2>
    <p class="lede">
      See finisher stories, route updates and behind-the-scenes from the cannons on Instagram.
    </p>
    <a href="https://www.instagram.com/capetowncannonchallenge/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn">
      @capetowncannonchallenge
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .instagram-cta__inner {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 40rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .instagram-cta__inner h2 {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .instagram-cta__inner .lede {
    margin-inline: auto;
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  }
</style>
